WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:05.760
Take care... of Princess... Rebe...

00:07.170 --> 00:08.970
Hey, Elda...

00:09.240 --> 00:10.610
Elda!

00:10.610 --> 00:12.230
Elda!

00:13.140 --> 00:15.270
If I'm to be reborn...

00:17.180 --> 00:20.150
I don't want it to be as me!

00:21.820 --> 00:29.560
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:29.560 --> 00:36.520
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:49.880 --> 00:56.080
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

00:56.080 --> 01:03.050
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:03.260 --> 01:09.560
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:09.560 --> 01:16.700
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:19.140 --> 01:26.550
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:26.550 --> 01:32.520
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:32.520 --> 01:40.160
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:40.160 --> 01:47.030
Tooku tooi basho e to

01:53.880 --> 01:58.040
Episode 14
The Lure of Power

02:14.230 --> 02:16.200
I did it again...

02:28.480 --> 02:30.280
Zed!

02:30.280 --> 02:31.910
Roya!

02:35.320 --> 02:38.820
So, this matter is finally concluded.

02:38.820 --> 02:42.190
However, we still have the
casualties and material losses

02:42.190 --> 02:44.960
the city suffered from the Zymot attack.

02:44.960 --> 02:49.160
And the annihilation of the special
unit we sent after the Joker.

02:49.160 --> 02:52.130
We have lost much.

02:52.130 --> 02:56.600
However, even though we were not
able to prosecute Dumas,

02:56.600 --> 02:59.900
he did receive the greatest possible punishment.

03:02.710 --> 03:05.210
We will hasten the strengthening
of the shard barrier

03:05.210 --> 03:08.550
so that this does not happen again.

03:08.550 --> 03:09.650
Yes, sir.

03:09.650 --> 03:13.450
As for you, Robès, good work
on your special mission.

03:14.020 --> 03:16.490
If you appear at the next board
of inquiry meeting,

03:16.490 --> 03:18.620
the matter of your crimes will be dropped.

03:19.460 --> 03:21.260
Gee, thanks.

03:31.970 --> 03:36.540
I see, so my teacher died in Zymot.

03:36.540 --> 03:38.170
Yeah...

03:38.780 --> 03:43.740
But you know, it's thanks to Mr. Dumas
that we got back here safely!

03:44.790 --> 03:49.160
A lot of stuff happened,
but in the end he helped us.

03:49.160 --> 03:50.780
Right?

03:51.760 --> 03:53.390
Yeah...

03:54.960 --> 03:56.760
I see...

04:12.280 --> 04:16.650
Templar, Neotopia, Zymot, Tusk...

04:16.650 --> 04:21.320
The battles between the territories
are only intensifying.

04:21.320 --> 04:24.060
But the first issue to deal with is Zymot.

04:24.060 --> 04:29.560
Zymot completely purged itself of its old royal
authority and established a new order.

04:29.560 --> 04:32.470
It is the greatest danger threatening Templar.

04:32.470 --> 04:36.000
The Joker leaked an incalculable
amount of intelligence to them.

04:36.000 --> 04:39.610
What's more, they are establishing ever
more friendly relations with Tusk.

04:39.610 --> 04:41.210
Philanthropy and harmony...

04:41.210 --> 04:44.450
Templar is too fragile to protect them.

04:44.450 --> 04:48.920
Is that not the purpose of Templar's
alliance with my land of Neotopia?

04:48.920 --> 04:53.390
We will certainly not permit Zymot
and Tusk to do as they please.

04:53.390 --> 04:58.090
Templar seeks an even firmer framework
for cooperation with Neotopia.

04:58.090 --> 04:59.890
Naturally...

04:59.890 --> 05:04.100
The dangers encircling Templar
are steadily increasing.

05:04.100 --> 05:07.140
Khan, with that firmly in mind,

05:07.140 --> 05:10.610
keep a close watch on Zymot's movements.

05:10.610 --> 05:12.400
Yes, sir.

05:18.310 --> 05:21.550
Find the Kalb-Hu hideout as fast as you can.

05:21.550 --> 05:23.690
Tell me as soon as you've discovered it.

05:23.690 --> 05:25.850
You may dispose of anyone in your way.

05:25.850 --> 05:27.650
Yes, sir!

05:29.720 --> 05:35.430
Hey, did you read the report on that " Zed"
guy who took down Glaudio?

05:35.430 --> 05:36.430
Yes...

05:36.430 --> 05:39.560
Glaudio is useless now after all.

05:41.140 --> 05:43.470
What will you do, Hugh?

05:43.470 --> 05:47.510
Doesn't this " Zed" kid have
you at all concerned?

05:47.510 --> 05:49.980
I don't have the time for that right now.

05:50.950 --> 05:52.910
I suppose not...

05:54.720 --> 05:57.840
You were getting friendly with
the princess and all.

06:06.090 --> 06:08.700
Wh..Who is this spirit?

06:08.700 --> 06:10.130
Pronimo.

06:10.130 --> 06:11.330
Pronimo?

06:11.330 --> 06:14.940
The legendary spirit wielded by Bakkam.

06:14.940 --> 06:17.240
You finally got your hands on him?

06:17.240 --> 06:18.870
Yes...

06:20.140 --> 06:24.440
Do you intend to rule all the
lands with this spirit?

06:25.110 --> 06:27.410
If that is the natural course of events.

06:33.090 --> 06:37.660
So, you intend to rule all the lands
and become Tusker then!

06:37.660 --> 06:39.190
What a delightful man you are.

06:39.190 --> 06:41.990
Okay, I'll help you out.

06:44.300 --> 06:47.540
First, I'll secure the whole of Zymot.

06:47.540 --> 06:50.470
Elmeida, you take Kalb-Hu.

06:50.470 --> 06:52.440
Leave it to me.

07:01.320 --> 07:03.280
Tusker, eh?

07:07.720 --> 07:09.350
Noah?

07:13.160 --> 07:15.230
So, this is where you were?

07:15.230 --> 07:17.530
Yes, do you need something?

07:19.000 --> 07:20.470
Noah...

07:20.470 --> 07:23.770
Unfortunately, we have to part ways here.

07:23.770 --> 07:27.480
Oh? It's been decided that you're going
back to your homeland then?

07:27.480 --> 07:28.480
Yes...

07:28.480 --> 07:32.780
I'm sorry, but we can't take
you with us any further.

07:33.180 --> 07:34.750
Forgive me.

07:34.750 --> 07:37.290
It's all right, I understand.

07:37.290 --> 07:41.240
I don't know how to thank you for all
the kindness you've shown me.

07:41.820 --> 07:43.450
Noah!

07:44.190 --> 07:47.650
Hey, teach me how to fold a paper plane!

07:48.830 --> 07:52.630
Sagiri! We're having an important
conversation right now.

07:56.500 --> 07:58.470
Wait for me in the tent, okay?

07:58.470 --> 08:00.370
I'll be right there.

08:00.370 --> 08:03.170
Okay! Don't be long!

08:06.880 --> 08:10.750
Sagiri will be lonely when you're gone.

08:10.750 --> 08:13.650
Her birthday is the day after tomorrow.

08:13.650 --> 08:16.390
Will you celebrate it with us?

08:16.390 --> 08:18.020
Yes!

08:20.900 --> 08:22.630
Thanks for the food!

08:22.630 --> 08:26.000
Your homemade bread was as
delicious as ever, Mickey.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.870
Thanks.

08:27.870 --> 08:29.500
Oh, are you going somewhere?

08:29.500 --> 08:30.740
Yeah...

08:30.740 --> 08:33.710
I have something I really want
to ask the old man.

08:34.340 --> 08:36.580
Hey, wait a second.

08:36.580 --> 08:39.050
I'm going to town too, to look for a job,

08:39.050 --> 08:41.340
so let's go partway together.

08:41.880 --> 08:44.010
Do you have any leads?

08:44.920 --> 08:47.890
I just have to find any job, whatever job I can.

08:48.320 --> 08:50.660
Teacher isn't here anymore after all.

08:50.660 --> 08:54.790
Plus, at this rate, I'll be eating nothing but bread!

08:56.000 --> 08:58.500
Hey, why not try selling this bread?

08:58.500 --> 09:00.300
Huh? You're kidding...

09:00.300 --> 09:01.740
It wouldn't sell.

09:01.740 --> 09:03.940
No worries, it's delicious!

09:03.940 --> 09:05.310
I'm telling you, it's bound to sell!

09:05.310 --> 09:07.440
Now that that's settled, let's get cracking!

09:07.440 --> 09:09.280
We'll help you!

09:09.280 --> 09:11.070
Right, Zed?

09:13.480 --> 09:15.110
Right?

09:41.710 --> 09:43.510
Huh? What's this?

09:43.810 --> 09:45.380
You think it's no good?

09:45.380 --> 09:47.680
I tried changing the shape a little.

09:49.380 --> 09:51.750
Nah, I think this could work!
It's totally cute!

09:51.750 --> 09:53.590
Let's bake all of them in this shape.

09:53.590 --> 09:54.990
People will love them!

09:54.990 --> 09:56.620
Right?

10:15.680 --> 10:19.980
Master Robès, someone is here to escort
you to the board of inquiry.

10:30.860 --> 10:32.860
Would anyone like some bread?

10:32.860 --> 10:35.160
We have freshly-baked bread!

10:35.160 --> 10:36.600
Would anyone like some?

10:36.600 --> 10:38.570
Say it louder!

10:39.430 --> 10:40.900
Would anyone like some bread?

10:40.900 --> 10:42.700
Fresh bread here!

10:42.700 --> 10:44.640
Come on down!

10:44.640 --> 10:46.940
Anyone for some freshly-baked bread?

10:47.680 --> 10:49.640
Come on down!

10:54.550 --> 10:56.250
No one's buying.

10:56.250 --> 10:59.320
But why? It's so delicious too!

10:59.320 --> 11:02.780
Teacher liked my bread too.

11:10.600 --> 11:13.570
And so do we, Mickey!

11:14.270 --> 11:17.200
And everyone else will like it, once they try it.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.640
If business goes well,

11:18.640 --> 11:21.940
you'll be able to have fun and train
and stuff like you used to.

11:22.910 --> 11:25.110
Mr. Dumas isn't here anymore,

11:25.110 --> 11:28.080
but Zed and I are. Right, Mickey?

11:31.220 --> 11:33.190
You have us.

11:39.060 --> 11:41.000
I guess we've got no choice.

11:41.000 --> 11:43.290
Maybe we should play our trump card.

11:50.870 --> 11:52.410
Bread?

11:52.410 --> 11:53.710
Yeah!

11:53.710 --> 11:56.680
" Trump card" my butt! He's just peddling!

11:57.410 --> 11:58.450
Yeah...

11:58.450 --> 12:01.050
No! This is door-to-door sales!

12:01.050 --> 12:06.420
I'm very sorry, but our estate uses
one baker exclusively.

12:06.420 --> 12:08.390
Don't be so stingy!

12:08.390 --> 12:10.060
Come on, just try one!

12:10.060 --> 12:10.660
But...

12:10.660 --> 12:12.630
This bread is really good.
But...

12:13.430 --> 12:15.220
It really is tasty!

12:16.260 --> 12:17.530
Please, sir!

12:17.530 --> 12:19.600
Please, even just one!

12:19.600 --> 12:20.970
No, buy all of them.

12:20.970 --> 12:23.770
Well then, I'll take one for my
own dinner tonight.

12:24.370 --> 12:26.000
One?!

12:26.370 --> 12:28.010
What? I... But...

12:28.010 --> 12:29.640
Why?

12:30.850 --> 12:33.180
Damn it, what a cheap old guy.

12:33.180 --> 12:36.150
Anyway, what should we do
with the leftover bread?

12:36.950 --> 12:38.190
Hey...

12:38.190 --> 12:39.390
What is it?

12:39.390 --> 12:41.490
We still have some time before nightfall,

12:41.490 --> 12:44.290
so maybe we can make this work if we split up.

12:45.560 --> 12:46.890
Yeah, good idea!

12:46.890 --> 12:48.860
Let's to that, okay?

12:50.970 --> 12:53.470
I'll go out by the west gate, okay?

12:53.470 --> 12:55.740
Okay, I'll go by the east gate, then.

12:55.740 --> 12:58.170
Then, I'll swing by some places too.

12:58.170 --> 12:58.470
Later!

12:58.470 --> 12:59.940
Right!
Later!

13:11.990 --> 13:13.780
Old man...

13:23.500 --> 13:25.330
Stop the carriage.

13:25.330 --> 13:27.430
Anyone for some bread?

13:27.430 --> 13:29.560
Would anyone like some nice bread?

13:31.870 --> 13:33.670
Wait here a bit.

13:35.410 --> 13:37.340
Thank you, sir.

13:37.340 --> 13:40.850
How unusual it is to see someone selling
bread on the street corners.

13:40.850 --> 13:42.480
Mr. Robès?

13:44.220 --> 13:46.520
Oh! You're...

13:46.520 --> 13:47.990
Who, again?

13:47.990 --> 13:50.830
Master Dumas's pupil, Mickey.

13:50.830 --> 13:52.490
Dumas's pupil?

13:52.490 --> 13:54.530
Come to think of it,
I sort of feel like he had one...

13:54.530 --> 13:57.100
You don't have to force yourself to remember.

13:57.100 --> 13:58.230
Sheesh...

13:58.230 --> 14:00.860
I'm working right now, so please excuse me.

14:01.900 --> 14:03.870
I'm joking, Mickey.

14:05.270 --> 14:09.780
Do you mean to continue training
as a shard caster?

14:09.780 --> 14:12.410
Y..Yes, I think so...

14:12.910 --> 14:14.820
Wh..What is it?

14:14.820 --> 14:17.110
I'll give you a nice present.

14:20.620 --> 14:23.820
You know about my spirit, don't you?

14:23.820 --> 14:25.790
Please tell me.

14:26.630 --> 14:30.930
You've become much more humble
since I last saw you.

14:32.230 --> 14:34.370
Amir Gaul...

14:34.370 --> 14:38.670
" One of the valuable spirits with
extraordinary fighting capacity. "

14:39.140 --> 14:41.180
But that's not the whole story.

14:41.180 --> 14:44.280
After getting another spirit,
I realized it for the first time.

14:44.280 --> 14:47.250
Amir Gaul is something totally different.

14:48.250 --> 14:50.380
You must know!

14:51.490 --> 14:54.110
What good will the knowledge do you?

14:55.220 --> 14:58.190
I have something left to do in Zymot.

15:03.530 --> 15:05.830
This veil is Rebecca's .

15:12.740 --> 15:14.370
Rebecca...

15:15.040 --> 15:16.410
All right, you two.

15:16.410 --> 15:18.410
It's about time to head back to Templar.

15:18.410 --> 15:20.680
Hey! Don't go deciding that on your own!

15:20.680 --> 15:22.480
Rebecca is still...

15:23.580 --> 15:24.990
Why you...

15:24.990 --> 15:26.320
Zed!

15:26.320 --> 15:29.020
Master Robès, why did you do that?

15:29.020 --> 15:31.630
The old man asked me to, you see.

15:31.630 --> 15:34.920
I can't let you two die as well.

15:35.500 --> 15:37.290
But that doesn't ...

15:38.530 --> 15:40.330
Rebecca...

15:49.410 --> 15:51.510
I'm going to save Rebecca.

15:51.510 --> 15:54.480
I need Amir Gaul's power to do that!

15:54.480 --> 15:55.820
Out of the question!

15:55.820 --> 15:58.620
It would be foolhardy to venture
into Zymot now.

15:58.620 --> 16:01.590
It could even cause damage to Templar itself!

16:02.460 --> 16:03.760
I don't care!

16:03.760 --> 16:06.560
I'll do what I want to, and that's all!

16:07.730 --> 16:10.030
Please, tell me.

16:11.630 --> 16:13.600
It's not about words.

16:14.800 --> 16:20.540
Your body and your heart have
begun to sense it.

16:20.540 --> 16:24.340
It's not something you can be told in words.

16:26.450 --> 16:31.080
If you keep seeking it, the answer
will come to you in due course.

16:31.520 --> 16:33.490
Don't be in such a rush.

17:06.490 --> 17:08.460
Don't be in such a rush.

17:11.960 --> 17:13.760
Damn it!

17:24.440 --> 17:25.740
Here it is again.

17:25.740 --> 17:28.010
I can hear it again!

17:28.010 --> 17:29.310
What is it?

17:29.310 --> 17:31.280
What are you trying to tell me?

17:36.650 --> 17:37.990
That was...

17:37.990 --> 17:39.650
The time has come at last.

17:39.650 --> 17:43.420
I did not think we would set foot
in the land of Rion again.

17:43.420 --> 17:45.730
Even now, I hardly believe it.

17:45.730 --> 17:51.000
Countless eons have passed since
our people left Rion,

17:51.000 --> 17:53.300
enough time for us to forget our mission.

17:53.970 --> 17:58.110
What in the world is in this Ark?

17:58.110 --> 18:00.770
We have no need to know that.

18:00.770 --> 18:04.010
We merely follow the tradition of
our race and carry it to Rion.

18:04.010 --> 18:07.970
Because that is our mission, and it is our fate.

18:29.840 --> 18:32.140
This is a memento of Dumas.

18:32.140 --> 18:34.110
You can have it.

18:34.910 --> 18:36.710
Teacher...

18:41.720 --> 18:45.620
Now is the time for our full-scale
assault on Templar.

18:45.620 --> 18:48.420
How we have waited, Joker.

18:49.520 --> 18:51.150
Sir...

18:52.790 --> 18:55.420
Then, proceed as planned, Joker.

19:18.850 --> 19:23.220
Why did I run away then?

19:23.220 --> 19:27.850
If I had stopped my teacher then...

19:29.230 --> 19:31.000
Why?

19:31.000 --> 19:32.630
If I'd ...

19:32.630 --> 19:34.930
If I'd been stronger...

19:38.740 --> 19:40.370
Teacher...

19:41.840 --> 19:45.470
Teacher might not have had to die!

19:49.820 --> 19:52.110
I want to become strong.

20:00.790 --> 20:03.590
You there, what are you doing here?

20:04.230 --> 20:06.530
This area is off-limits.

20:07.470 --> 20:09.090
Hey...

20:09.770 --> 20:12.740
Thank you, Master Sebastian!

20:12.740 --> 20:16.940
We are giving thought to Mickey's future too.

20:16.940 --> 20:18.780
There's no need to worry.

20:18.780 --> 20:21.010
Thank you, sir!

20:21.010 --> 20:23.980
Oh, that's right, wait here a moment.

20:26.620 --> 20:29.590
Feed these to Zed and Mickey.

20:31.290 --> 20:32.920
Yes, sir!

20:46.410 --> 20:48.840
Huh? Mickey?

20:48.840 --> 20:50.780
So, you're home already.

20:50.780 --> 20:52.210
Are you all by yourself?

20:52.210 --> 20:54.180
Zed isn't back yet?

20:55.080 --> 20:57.050
Mickey?

20:58.920 --> 21:01.190
Maybe he didn't sell any bread...

21:01.190 --> 21:02.190
Hey, get this!

21:02.190 --> 21:05.360
Master Sebastian bought all the bread I had,

21:05.360 --> 21:08.820
and on top of that he gave us these
vegetables and fish!

21:16.340 --> 21:18.130
Hey, what's wrong?

21:20.070 --> 21:22.110
Hang in there!

21:22.110 --> 21:24.180
My spirit was...

21:24.180 --> 21:25.650
Your spirit?

21:25.650 --> 21:27.610
...stolen...

21:40.260 --> 21:42.230
Oh, man...

21:46.530 --> 21:48.500
I' so sorry, Mickey.

21:53.340 --> 21:56.470
Stronger... Stronger...

21:56.740 --> 21:57.440
Mi..Mickey?

21:57.440 --> 21:59.240
Stronger...
Mi..Mickey?

22:00.550 --> 22:03.180
Stronger!

22:25.640 --> 22:27.040
Slugna...

22:27.040 --> 22:28.840
Why is he here?

22:42.020 --> 22:44.620
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.620 --> 22:47.460
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.460 --> 22:52.420
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.770 --> 22:58.410
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.410 --> 23:04.370
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.420 --> 23:14.820
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.820 --> 23:18.620
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.330 --> 23:23.060
Kono michi o tobashite

23:23.060 --> 23:30.530
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.200 --> 23:33.870
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.870 --> 23:36.640
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.640 --> 23:41.600
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.120 --> 23:47.650
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.650 --> 23:53.790
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:17.420 --> 24:20.980
Next Time
A Small Treasure

24:17.620 --> 24:20.980


Next time, "A Small Treasure"
